in-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二：7：20从体育馆南门入场</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三：7：25从体育馆南门入场</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">龙山书院：7：20从体育馆北门入场</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>地点</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">锡麟体育馆</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>、参加人员</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校领导班子、嘉宾、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育集团全体师生</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>、流程</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">暖场：纪念抗战胜利80周年活动</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主持人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开场</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奏唱国歌</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委副书记、校长蒋明老师讲话</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">毕业生代表</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宋长纬</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学视频发言</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三学生代表谢安毅同学发言</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局党委副书记、市委教育工委专职副书记、绍兴一中党委书记丁初效老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宣读30年教龄老师名单、颁奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孔君</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、张坚秋、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;paddi