argin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一年级管委会主任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师宣读各类奖学金获奖名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">b.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委委员</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三年级管委会主任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师宣读</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">信息学、数学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞赛获奖名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">c.绍兴市教育局专职督学任联君</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师宣读<span style="font-family: Calibri; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.68px; text-wrap-mode: wrap;">物理、</span></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">化学、生物</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、天文</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞赛获奖名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">10</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">颁奖仪式（获奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生分批上台领奖，全体领导和嘉宾颁发）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">11</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奏唱校歌</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   典礼结束，各班整理场地凳子，有序退场</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: yellow;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">10：00各年段分区域观看阅兵式</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一9：40前往图书馆报告厅看阅兵式，高二高三在本班教室观看，龙山书院同学回龙山校区观看。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>六、要求</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.全体学生要求统一着夏装校服（上身藏青色短袖有领T恤，下身藏青色运动短裤或长裤），各班一路纵队女生在前，男生在后按照指定位置就坐；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.领奖学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坐班级最后区域</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">听德育处</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、年管会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师指挥，等候颁奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.教师坐在后侧教工席，满30年教龄教师坐在嘉宾席；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.班主任下班管理纪律；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.各班班长提前清点各班座位，当天7:00到达体育馆南门领取班牌，并坐在班级的第一位；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.开学典礼结束后要求各班把凳子每5张叠在一起，2位体育委员负责搬回原处。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>七</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>、筹备工作</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.总务处：舞台布置</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">音响话筒等设备，音频视频控制：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">张帆、祝建强、胡建国</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.教学处：统计教学线获奖情况，打印奖状证书</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.高一学生（每班10人）：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">周二中午12：30</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">凳子等场地布置</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.党政办：教工参会通知，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">满</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">30</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教龄教师通知，嘉宾邀请，提供集体市直及以上荣誉名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.摄影、摄像：舒凤、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校电视台学生</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.德育处、团委、安全处：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分工安排：马丹娜</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班牌及入场指挥（马丹娜、王佩金、何隽豪、王宁）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校园网公告（诸佳英）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各类名单汇总（张晨卉、诸佳英）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">流程ppt（张晨卉、诸佳英）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">台签、学生座位表安排及背景喷绘（茹敏）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">礼仪、鲜花（王青、任宇颖）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">领导邀请（刘明玉）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学线、德育线领奖人员通知（王佩金、任宇颖）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直及以上领奖人员通知及奖状证书（王青）       </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">安全维护（何隽豪、王宁）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>开学典礼各班座位表如下：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">           舞台</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bott